.worktrees/

# Locally built databases (hostus ingest --db out/...). Multi-GB and
# never a repository artifact. Ignored for two measured reasons, not
# just tidiness: an implementer once committed a 2.26 GB database from
# here because nothing stopped it, and `make mutation` fills the disk —
# gremlins copies the whole working tree per mutant, so an un-ignored
# 8.5 GB out/ left 451 GB of temp copies behind in one run.
/out/
